              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu aliniambia, “Nenda tena ukampende mwanamke anayependwa na mwanamume mwingine na ambaye ni mzinzi. Mpende kama mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu ninavyowapenda Waisraeli, ingawa wao wanaigeukia miungu mingine na kuwa na uchu wa maandazi ya zabibu kavu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, nikamnunua huyo mwanamke kwa vipande kumi na vitano vya fedha na magunia mengi ya shayiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha nikamwambia, “Lazima uwe wangu kwa siku nyingi bila kufanya uzinzi au kuwa mke wa mtu mwingine; nami pia nitakuwa mwaminifu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo ndivyo Waisraeli watakavyokuwa: Watakaa kwa muda mrefu bila mfalme au mkuu; bila tambiko, wala mnara wala kizibao cha kifuani wala kinyago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadaye, Waisraeli watarudi na kumtafuta Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao, na kumtafuta mfalme wao, mzawa wa Daudi. Ndipo watakapomcha Mwenyezi-Mungu, na kutazamia wema wake siku za mwisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
